WEBVTT

00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:14.830
Good evening, everyone, and thank you all so much for gathering here today in my honor.

00:00:15.710 --> 00:00:18.300
The Blazing Dark Elf was only able to become such a smash hit

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:21.220
thanks to my peerless literary prowess,

00:00:21.220 --> 00:00:24.920
Arumi-sensei's wonderful
illustrations, and of course...

00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:28.390
the support of everyone here in this room!

00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:31.890
I can't thank you all enough!

00:00:31.890 --> 00:00:34.670
So let's all have a ton of fun tonight!

00:00:36.910 --> 00:00:39.140
Sounds good to me.

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:40.890
Start the...

00:00:41.570 --> 00:00:43.340
music!

00:01:32.820 --> 00:01:38.570
"Yamada Elf's Love Song"

00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:43.700
Things are going really great for Elf.
She's even getting her own celebration event.

00:01:44.320 --> 00:01:47.210
Yeah, Elf-chan's pretty amazing.

00:01:47.560 --> 00:01:49.650
She'll probably start gloating as soon as we see her.

00:01:49.650 --> 00:01:51.540
Ah, I can't stand this! I'm so jealous!

00:01:51.540 --> 00:01:53.920
We're not going to lose to her!

00:01:55.680 --> 00:01:58.550
Of course! We're going to surpass her before she knows it!

00:01:59.940 --> 00:02:01.760
That's the spirit!

00:02:02.360 --> 00:02:03.720
All right!

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:06.880
Um, Nii-san. Close your eyes for a minute.

00:02:08.020 --> 00:02:09.270
Sure.

00:02:11.210 --> 00:02:12.520
You can open them now.

00:02:18.470 --> 00:02:20.010
H-How do I look?

00:02:20.010 --> 00:02:21.720
Super cute!

00:02:22.460 --> 00:02:24.500
I put some extra effort in today.

00:02:26.250 --> 00:02:27.290
Nii-san...

00:02:31.510 --> 00:02:32.640
Perfect.

00:02:32.640 --> 00:02:35.000
It kinda feels like we're newlyweds.

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:36.080
Jeez!

00:02:37.880 --> 00:02:40.800
You're in charge of going to
Elf-chan's party for both of us, okay?

00:02:41.280 --> 00:02:43.010
Right! Leave it to me!

00:02:44.030 --> 00:02:44.840
Yeah!

00:02:49.310 --> 00:02:50.440
"Reception Desk"

00:02:55.200 --> 00:02:58.320
This is insanely fancy.

00:02:58.320 --> 00:03:00.470
Should we switch publishers?

00:03:00.470 --> 00:03:02.130
Yeah. Let's.

00:03:03.610 --> 00:03:07.850
You've had events like this held in your honor,
haven't you, Muramasa-san?

00:03:09.720 --> 00:03:10.370
And you're...?

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:12.000
Shidou Kunimitsu!

00:03:17.510 --> 00:03:18.970
"Congratulations on 5 million units sold"

00:03:17.930 --> 00:03:19.820
How have you all been doing?

00:03:19.010 --> 00:03:20.880
"The super-popular dark fantasy series"

00:03:19.820 --> 00:03:21.080
We're doing well.

00:03:20.970 --> 00:03:22.590
"The Blazing Dark Elf"

00:03:21.080 --> 00:03:22.090
It's just that...

00:03:22.760 --> 00:03:24.260
"Sexplosion!"

00:03:23.400 --> 00:03:26.990
I'm getting that "we'll never catch up
to her" feeling right about now.

00:03:24.430 --> 00:03:25.970
"I'm sorry, but please die now."

00:03:25.970 --> 00:03:26.970
"A battle to decide the next king X A romcom"

00:03:26.990 --> 00:03:28.060
I know the feeling.

00:03:27.220 --> 00:03:28.060
"With a little bit of lewd"

00:03:28.060 --> 00:03:29.430
Let's both give it our all.

00:03:32.630 --> 00:03:33.850
Hi, everyone!

00:03:38.830 --> 00:03:40.650
Thanks for coming.

00:03:42.230 --> 00:03:43.190
Of course.

00:03:43.190 --> 00:03:45.030
We can't miss our friend's big day.

00:03:45.380 --> 00:03:46.820
Congratulations.

00:03:47.900 --> 00:03:49.480
What do you think, Masamune?

00:03:49.480 --> 00:03:53.440
Don't I look absolutely stunning?

00:03:55.680 --> 00:03:57.460
You're blushing.

00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:03.010
Hello there, Eromanga-sensei.

00:04:03.010 --> 00:04:05.370
I don't know anyone by the name.

00:04:07.090 --> 00:04:08.680
Congratulations, Elf-chan.

00:04:09.880 --> 00:04:11.050
Thanks.

00:04:11.050 --> 00:04:13.100
Here, this is from all of us to you.

00:04:13.640 --> 00:04:15.150
Thanks!

00:04:15.150 --> 00:04:16.600
I wonder what it is.

00:04:17.430 --> 00:04:18.470
Congratulations,

00:04:20.310 --> 00:04:21.830
Yamada Elf-sensei.

00:04:30.210 --> 00:04:33.220
Thank you, Izumi Masamune-sensei.

00:04:39.580 --> 00:04:41.740
Should I put your stuff down here?

00:04:41.740 --> 00:04:43.590
Yeah, thanks.

00:04:44.210 --> 00:04:46.970
You said your mom's coming too, right?

00:04:46.970 --> 00:04:49.790
She said she'd be joining us after I sent her an invitation.

00:04:50.540 --> 00:04:53.100
My mother really loves me.

00:04:54.430 --> 00:04:57.190
It looks like you really love her too.

00:04:57.610 --> 00:04:58.680
Yeah!

00:04:58.680 --> 00:05:00.940
I'll introduce you to her when she gets here.

00:05:01.260 --> 00:05:02.030
Sounds good.

00:05:02.690 --> 00:05:04.370
Okay, I'm going to head back to the party.

00:05:04.370 --> 00:05:06.410
Oh, wait a second.

00:05:10.140 --> 00:05:12.250
Can you help me get undressed?

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:14.080
Wh-What did you just say?!

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:16.040
I-I can't do it by myself.

00:05:16.360 --> 00:05:18.060
Ask someone else...

00:05:18.060 --> 00:05:18.760
Oh.

00:05:26.440 --> 00:05:27.550
<i>Ass!</i>

00:05:27.550 --> 00:05:30.420
Wait, are you not wearing panties?!

00:05:30.420 --> 00:05:32.490
Of course I am! They're...

00:05:32.490 --> 00:05:33.220
They're what?

00:05:34.070 --> 00:05:35.680
They're just small.

00:05:36.750 --> 00:05:38.590
O-Okay then.

00:05:45.860 --> 00:05:46.570
The...

00:05:47.100 --> 00:05:48.180
The top too.

00:05:55.300 --> 00:05:55.870
Huh?

00:05:56.920 --> 00:05:59.500
<i>Haven't I been in this situation before?</i>

00:06:01.720 --> 00:06:03.420
I-It's not what it looks like!

00:06:12.640 --> 00:06:15.840
On second thought, I'd better not.

00:06:15.840 --> 00:06:17.660
Masamune-kun sure is taking a while.

00:06:17.660 --> 00:06:19.400
Muramasa-chan, go that way.

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:20.600
O-Okay.

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:23.940
"Yamada Elf-sensei"

00:06:23.020 --> 00:06:26.690
Once again, I apologize for my younger sister's behavior.

00:06:27.040 --> 00:06:28.500
It's fine.

00:06:28.500 --> 00:06:33.360
I mean, really, why did you even bring that many changes of clothes?

00:06:33.360 --> 00:06:35.940
To unveil them in front of everyone, of course.

00:06:35.940 --> 00:06:37.500
You know, like, "Feast your eyes on me!"

00:06:37.980 --> 00:06:41.500
This celebration is all for you,
so you can do whatever you want, but...

00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:44.770
Whatever you do, make sure you show
respect to everyone who came here for you.

00:06:44.770 --> 00:06:46.520
You don't need to worry about that.

00:06:46.520 --> 00:06:48.260
You saying that only makes me worry more.

00:06:48.260 --> 00:06:51.030
Shouldn't Mother be arriving about now?

00:06:54.070 --> 00:06:56.280
Chris has trouble dealing with our mother.

00:06:56.280 --> 00:06:57.770
He <i>did</i> run away from home, you know.

00:06:58.080 --> 00:06:59.830
Watch your mouth.

00:07:25.800 --> 00:07:28.300
Mother! It's been so long!

00:07:30.260 --> 00:07:32.360
Let me introduce you.

00:07:32.360 --> 00:07:32.840
This is...

00:07:32.840 --> 00:07:34.770
Izumi Masamune-kun.

00:07:34.770 --> 00:07:36.140
Y-Yes?!

00:07:43.100 --> 00:07:45.230
You need to break up with my daughter.

00:07:45.650 --> 00:07:46.360
Huh?

00:07:48.070 --> 00:07:49.870
U-Um...

00:07:53.990 --> 00:07:55.830
But we're not dating.

00:07:56.420 --> 00:07:58.290
Oh? Really?

00:07:59.120 --> 00:08:00.880
That's not what I was told.

00:08:00.880 --> 00:08:03.040
W-Wai— Hold o— M-Mother!

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:04.680
Remember?

00:08:04.680 --> 00:08:08.170
"My loving boyfriend and I swore to each other we'd share our lives together."

00:08:09.720 --> 00:08:11.740
Wh-What're you talking about?!

00:08:12.510 --> 00:08:14.840
I got a new boyfriend in Japan!

00:08:17.800 --> 00:08:19.800
My boyfriend saw me completely naked.

00:08:19.800 --> 00:08:21.810
I have to make him take responsibility.

00:08:21.810 --> 00:08:23.610
That was an accident!

00:08:23.610 --> 00:08:25.650
B-B-But you <i>did</i> see me naked.

00:08:26.020 --> 00:08:28.350
We had a date at a café in Iidabashi!

00:08:28.350 --> 00:08:30.520
We went on a trip. Only he and I.

00:08:30.520 --> 00:08:32.550
We took a bath at the hot springs together.

00:08:32.550 --> 00:08:34.700
We play fun games like this all the time.

00:08:34.980 --> 00:08:36.570
That was nothing but lies!

00:08:36.570 --> 00:08:39.820
Th-Those weren't lies...
I just stretched the truth a little bit.

00:08:39.820 --> 00:08:41.530
Give me a break.

00:08:41.530 --> 00:08:45.030
No wonder she told me to break up with you. She thinks I'm a pervert.

00:08:45.030 --> 00:08:47.370
Would someone mind telling me what <i>actually</i> happened?

00:08:48.960 --> 00:08:51.800
The one who bathed together with him...

00:08:52.170 --> 00:08:53.170
was me.

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:54.220
What? Don't tell me...

00:08:54.220 --> 00:08:55.630
It's not like that!

00:08:55.970 --> 00:08:57.800
I'm not dating anyone.

00:08:58.220 --> 00:09:00.940
But there's someone else I really am in love with.

00:09:09.840 --> 00:09:11.800
Thanks for that, Muramasa-chan.

00:09:11.800 --> 00:09:14.520
I can't say no to a cute little sister.

00:09:14.520 --> 00:09:16.200
Why do you keep saying stuff like that?

00:09:17.700 --> 00:09:19.780
Oh, he's finally back.

00:09:20.570 --> 00:09:22.270
What took you so long?

00:09:22.270 --> 00:09:23.250
Sorry about that.

00:09:23.690 --> 00:09:25.850
Elf was introducing me to her mom—

00:09:25.850 --> 00:09:28.740
Izumi-saaaan!

00:09:28.740 --> 00:09:31.430
Ya finary came baaaack!

00:09:31.430 --> 00:09:33.930
Shidou-kun, you got drunk again?

00:09:36.300 --> 00:09:39.430
Mother, thank you for coming all the way here to see me.

00:09:39.430 --> 00:09:40.610
I'm so happ—

00:09:39.850 --> 00:09:41.810
Don't get the wrong idea about my visit here.

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:44.460
I didn't come to celebrate your success.

00:09:44.460 --> 00:09:45.190
Huh?

00:09:45.710 --> 00:09:49.850
Emily, pack all of your belongings by the end of tonight.

00:09:49.850 --> 00:09:52.740
I'm taking you back home once this is over.

00:09:52.740 --> 00:09:54.110
What are you...

00:09:55.950 --> 00:09:59.700
<i>I</i> am going to be the one who
chooses a suitable husband for you.

00:10:00.120 --> 00:10:03.170
What? Are you still going on about that?

00:10:03.170 --> 00:10:05.940
I told you I'd find one myself.

00:10:05.940 --> 00:10:07.580
You mean Izumi Masamune-kun?

00:10:09.870 --> 00:10:10.790
That's right.

00:10:12.250 --> 00:10:15.510
He said he's in love with someone else.

00:10:15.510 --> 00:10:16.840
That's right.

00:10:16.840 --> 00:10:18.380
He seemed very earnest about it.

00:10:18.380 --> 00:10:20.990
I don't think you'll be able to get between them.

00:10:19.720 --> 00:10:21.720
"The Cutest Little Sister in the World"

00:10:23.650 --> 00:10:25.000
I told you, he's the one I love!

00:10:25.000 --> 00:10:26.100
Enough!

00:10:26.660 --> 00:10:31.530
I've learned from experience that the hearts of earnest, foolish men like him never waver.

00:10:31.530 --> 00:10:33.230
You mean your experience with Father?

00:10:34.230 --> 00:10:37.010
H-He has nothing to do with this!

00:10:37.010 --> 00:10:40.410
I'm doing all of this so you won't have to suffer in the future!

00:10:40.410 --> 00:10:41.870
I don't <i>want</i> your help!

00:10:41.870 --> 00:10:43.780
Compose yourself right now!

00:10:44.790 --> 00:10:46.120
"The Cutest Little Sister in the World"

00:10:50.340 --> 00:10:51.380
It's just that...

00:10:52.060 --> 00:10:52.850
when I think about...

00:10:53.650 --> 00:10:54.320
how you and Fathe—

00:10:54.320 --> 00:10:58.420
By the end of tonight, have your bags packed and be ready to go home.

00:10:58.420 --> 00:10:59.680
Understood?

00:10:58.870 --> 00:10:59.680
I've had it!

00:11:12.660 --> 00:11:15.550
What? Do you have something to say?

00:11:15.550 --> 00:11:18.950
Her personality is nothing like yours.

00:11:18.950 --> 00:11:20.140
She reminds me of Father.

00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:23.770
And you remind me of myself.

00:11:23.770 --> 00:11:25.080
It's rather unpleasant.

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:26.870
Agreed.

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:37.150
Um, to everyone here who helped with the production of The Blazing Dark Elf anime,

00:11:37.150 --> 00:11:39.200
thank you for your hard work.

00:11:39.800 --> 00:11:43.680
If I recall correctly, it was just about two years ago...

00:11:47.640 --> 00:11:48.730
Elf?

00:11:50.280 --> 00:11:51.530
What're you doing down here?

00:11:53.560 --> 00:11:54.940
Aren't you going up on stage?

00:11:56.380 --> 00:11:58.010
I don't wanna go out there.

00:12:23.800 --> 00:12:27.680
So, um, I had a fight with my mother.

00:12:29.620 --> 00:12:30.740
Did you now?

00:12:31.960 --> 00:12:35.490
She doesn't understand me at all.

00:12:36.260 --> 00:12:36.880
Yeah.

00:12:38.110 --> 00:12:39.940
She's always been that way.

00:12:39.940 --> 00:12:41.570
She never listens to anyone!

00:12:41.930 --> 00:12:44.960
Then she just forces everyone to do what she thinks is right.

00:12:44.960 --> 00:12:47.640
It almost makes me hate her.

00:12:48.980 --> 00:12:50.290
But you love her, don't you?

00:12:50.290 --> 00:12:51.050
Yeah.

00:12:54.010 --> 00:12:56.550
And you mom loves you too, right?

00:12:58.110 --> 00:12:59.450
Well, yeah.

00:12:59.450 --> 00:13:01.660
Then I'm sure it'll be fine.

00:13:01.660 --> 00:13:03.010
Are you sure?

00:13:03.740 --> 00:13:04.680
Yeah.

00:13:07.710 --> 00:13:10.640
I'm sorry for making you listen to me complain so much.

00:13:10.960 --> 00:13:13.640
Don't worry about it.
It reminded me of when I was younger.

00:13:13.640 --> 00:13:16.350
Things with my mother were the same way.

00:13:19.010 --> 00:13:20.710
You just need to talk things out with her.

00:13:21.590 --> 00:13:23.090
She's your family, after all.

00:13:27.880 --> 00:13:28.670
Yeah!

00:13:34.540 --> 00:13:39.830
Introducing tonight's guest of honor,
the author of The Blazing Dark Elf, Yamada Elf.

00:13:37.950 --> 00:13:39.830
Okay, I'll give you the signal when I'm ready.

00:13:39.830 --> 00:13:40.960
Understood.

00:13:39.830 --> 00:13:45.070
Please join me in welcoming her with a big round of applause.

00:14:23.510 --> 00:14:24.460
Hello, everyone!

00:14:24.750 --> 00:14:27.730
Thanks for coming to celebrate with us tonight.

00:14:27.730 --> 00:14:31.720
You should all feel honored that you were able to witness the birth of a legend!

00:14:33.430 --> 00:14:35.310
The first step was selling five million units.

00:14:35.310 --> 00:14:39.520
Now I'm on the path to conquering the world through light novels.

00:14:39.520 --> 00:14:42.150
Does she really have to act like a fool for her speech?

00:14:42.150 --> 00:14:44.530
She's being herself. I like it.

00:14:45.400 --> 00:14:50.510
Thank you to everyone who worked so hard on the
anime adaptation and came here to support me,

00:14:50.510 --> 00:14:53.890
and thank you to my beloved
family who came here to see me.

00:14:53.890 --> 00:14:56.740
You've made this a very special and memorable day for me.

00:15:53.960 --> 00:15:57.060
I'll find the person I truly love on my own.

00:15:57.660 --> 00:15:59.560
And I'll grab that happiness with both hands.

00:16:13.950 --> 00:16:15.930
I wonder what falling in love will be like!

00:16:15.930 --> 00:16:18.010
I wonder who I'm going to marry!

00:16:18.010 --> 00:16:20.680
I took my idealized romance and turned it into a novel.

00:16:20.680 --> 00:16:23.830
And then the story unfolded from there.

00:16:24.210 --> 00:16:25.500
I'm a literary genius, aren't I?

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:26.500
Not even close.

00:16:26.030 --> 00:16:29.760
Throughout my adventurous new life,
I've met a lot of wonderful people!

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:27.500
Well, you know...

00:16:30.200 --> 00:16:31.460
The boy I fell for.

00:16:31.460 --> 00:16:33.010
My meddlesome friend.

00:16:33.010 --> 00:16:34.230
And of course...

00:16:36.430 --> 00:16:39.000
my cute love rival!

00:16:39.000 --> 00:16:42.680
Every day has brought with it new experiences, but I still want more!

00:16:42.680 --> 00:16:46.020
Because I swore that I'd become the happiest person in the world!

00:18:01.820 --> 00:18:06.350
My lovely parents always seemed so happy to be married to each other.

00:18:06.800 --> 00:18:10.440
My father earnestly loved my mother with all his heart.

00:18:10.440 --> 00:18:12.360
He was happy till the very end.

00:18:12.950 --> 00:18:15.190
I was always jealous of what they had,

00:18:15.730 --> 00:18:17.190
and that's why I...

00:19:35.230 --> 00:19:37.020
<i>I swear to you.</i>

00:19:37.020 --> 00:19:40.350
<i>I'll give her a life full of happiness.</i>

00:19:43.400 --> 00:19:44.640
Mother!

00:19:52.030 --> 00:19:53.470
Do as you please.

00:20:01.200 --> 00:20:02.210
I will!

00:20:09.650 --> 00:20:13.190
We even got gift bags.
That was some celebration.

00:20:13.190 --> 00:20:14.650
I know, wasn't it?

00:20:15.050 --> 00:20:15.960
And...

00:20:15.960 --> 00:20:16.650
And?

00:20:18.950 --> 00:20:22.020
You were really great back there.

00:20:22.560 --> 00:20:24.110
W-Was I?

00:20:24.640 --> 00:20:27.400
I mean, of course I was!

00:20:27.400 --> 00:20:32.120
Everyone was completely
enthralled by my performance!

00:20:32.120 --> 00:20:32.710
Guess so.

00:20:34.350 --> 00:20:35.340
You were also...

00:20:34.350 --> 00:20:36.040
Isn't the countdown about to start?

00:20:36.040 --> 00:20:37.510
Yeah, let's go see it.

00:20:41.480 --> 00:20:43.630
Did you talk things out with your mom?

00:20:44.590 --> 00:20:45.680
Yeah.

00:20:47.070 --> 00:20:49.640
Welcome to the Moonlight Garden!

00:20:49.640 --> 00:20:53.520
I think I was finally able to be a little more honest and open with her.

00:20:49.640 --> 00:20:52.830
The countdown will begin shortly.

00:20:53.890 --> 00:20:55.100
Five!

00:20:55.100 --> 00:20:56.610
Four!

00:20:56.610 --> 00:20:58.140
Three!

00:20:58.140 --> 00:20:59.610
Two!

00:20:58.970 --> 00:21:01.070
And it was all thanks to you, Masamune!

00:20:59.610 --> 00:21:00.360
One!

00:21:03.700 --> 00:21:05.280
It's amazing!

00:21:11.080 --> 00:21:16.260
The first time I realized how I felt was when you told me that reading my novels saved you.

00:21:17.690 --> 00:21:20.380
I'm really happy that I met you.

00:21:20.380 --> 00:21:21.840
Where's this all coming from?

00:21:23.040 --> 00:21:26.840
To be honest, I was planning on taking my time going after you.

00:21:28.810 --> 00:21:29.470
Listen...

00:21:30.400 --> 00:21:32.280
